* tafc-emulation: prime
* TAFC-CROSSCHECK.md section 2: default PRECISION 4, truncated results.
CRT 10/3, 2/3, -2/3, 1/7*7, 1/3*1000000, 1000000/3
CRT COS(1), SIN(45), TAN(34)*42, SQRT(2), EXP(1), LN(10), PWR(2,0.5)
X = 2/3 ; CRT X, X*3, LEN(X)
CRT 0.5555*0.5555, 0.0005*0.5, 0.0123*0.0123, 1.0001*1.0001
